ial or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Built to Blast","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/363acf36df9993daf8d0ea5a531a4a2e.png","desc":"Gain aim assist, stability, and flinch resistance while you have Woven Mail, Frost Armor, or Void Overshield."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Cornered","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4155ec85e6c1e11b24d9986f21528d34.png","desc":"Faster charge time or draw time when surrounded by combatants."},{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Well-Rounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/29d63faf15876cf3a9a382aa857b608b.png","desc":"Throwing a grenade or hitting a target with a charged melee grants a stacking bonus to weapon stability, handling, and range.\n\nUsing a Super grants maximum stacks."},{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."},{"name":"Heating Up","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/39d2032b3c5bc7a5b2fe391c64ccb7db.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase accuracy and stability while improving vertical recoil."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Lead from Gold","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/87f6cac4799cbae4e11ba74d3dc77504.png","desc":"Picking up Heavy ammo also grants ammo to this weapon."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weap